  "grammar_observation": {
    "target_language": "Ble mae'r papur? Mae'r papur ar y bwrdd, dan y bocs, wrth Iwan, tu ôl i'r silff, neu o flaen Dafi.",
    "bridge_language": "Ble mae…? asks where something is. Use ar for on, dan for under, wrth for beside, tu ôl i for behind, and o flaen for in front of."
  },
